<title>UK: Wessex Water sets tender for 10 pct of shrs.</title>
<headline>Wessex Water sets tender for 10 pct of shrs.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>British water and sewerage firm Wessex Water Plc said on Wednesday it planned a tender offer to buy back 10 percent of its ordinary shares not held by Waste Management International at 380p per share.</p>
</text>
